<title>USA: First Bell to buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>First Bell to buy back up to 5 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Pa. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bell Bancorp Inc said Monday it had received regulatory approval to buy back up to five percent of its common stock, or 387,907 of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Under the program, the company will repurchase First Bell stock through registered broker-dealers. The transactions are to be completed before June 29, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>The repurchase is to be funded by reductions in the company's current short-term portfolio, it said.</p>
